{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/extras/36447af43b58b2823a3e3cafd584062b.poster.avif?t=1759207759\" width=1024 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/extras/36447af43b58b2823a3e3cafd584062b.webm?t=1759207759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/extras/36447af43b58b2823a3e3cafd584062b.mp4?t=1759207759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time eroded the structures of your proud kingdom, and sealed the fate of your watchful guardian brethren. One day it will be the witness to your own last watch, but that day shall not come unfought.\u00a0Even as the very last vestige of the fallen empire, your vow to protect remains unbroken. Defend your domain against endless waves of vengeful wraiths and grotesque beasts. Gather resources to fuel your upgrades and fight back against the inevitable doom of your land using ingenious weaponry or magical spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive your watch by trying many different builds. Will you train a large army of villagers to defend yourself, rely on relentless artillery to bombard your enemies to ashes, or learn magical spells to call down deadly lightning or conjure devastating meteor strikes? Strengthen your economy to afford even more powerful upgrades. Restore your health and that of your villagers with healing magic, or take the desperate route and use shamanic rituals, sacrificing your own men to gain strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/extras/2c4e8926b414cedb184f30b8e9eb5918.poster.avif?t=1759207759\" width=356 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/extras/2c4e8926b414cedb184f30b8e9eb5918.webm?t=1759207759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/extras/2c4e8926b414cedb184f30b8e9eb5918.mp4?t=1759207759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death does not release you from your vow. After each defeat, prepare yourself for the next watch by unlocking permanent traits to shape the course of your next watch. Combine traits freely to experiment with different strategies. Discover powerful synergies and try your luck on your next watch.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026370?t=1759207759","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/4de7f8164ade3ab5a027af3e68349b703d5c2d00/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759207759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/e2c0bdd25ccc6071029ad5b169966af32d1c4d23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759207759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/e2c0bdd25ccc6071029ad5b169966af32d1c4d23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759207759","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/extras/36447af43b58b2823a3e3cafd584062b.poster.avif?t=1759207759\" width=1024 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026370/extras/36447af43b58b2823a3e3cafd584062b.webm?t=1759207759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic